.SH NAME
ssoossh-host-mapping-remove - Remove a principal or an entire account mapping.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBssoossh host mapping remove [flags] [args]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
With two arguments, removes the principal from the account (no-op if not present). With one argument, removes the entire account mapping.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
